        "text_LYnYze": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our mystery books for kids are written to keep pages turning from the first clue to the final reveal. We create stories that combine suspense and problem-solving with the kinds of character lessons families want more of, like honesty, responsibility, and thinking for yourself. Each book gives kids practice noticing details, asking better questions, and thinking for themselves as the story unfolds. Parents love that the stories hold their child’s attention while helping them grow more confident as readers and more thoughtful in how they process what they see.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
