    "ssky_faqs_hgN78D": {
      "type": "ssky-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MdKRCN": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold"
          }
        },
        "faq_WRG3Up": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>What Age Group Are Mystery Books for Kids Best For?</h5>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Our mystery books for kids are written for children who are building reading confidence, often between the ages of six and 12. The stories use clear language, fast-moving plots, and age-appropriate suspense to keep younger readers interested without feeling overwhelmed.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_qbCTw7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>Are Mystery Books Good for Reluctant Readers?</h5>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Mystery stories pull kids in because they want to solve the puzzle. Short chapters, clear pacing, and characters kids care about help readers stay focused. Many parents find that mystery books are the first stories their children choose to finish on their own.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_LizneF": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>Can Mystery Books Help With School Learning?</h5>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Mystery stories build skills kids use in school every day. Kids practice reading comprehension, logical thinking, and paying attention to details. As they follow clues and predict outcomes, they strengthen skills they use in writing, problem-solving, and everyday conversations about what they think and why.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_ENmNMp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>Do Your Mystery Books Include Positive Values?</h5>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our stories focus on honesty, responsibility, curiosity, and teamwork. Children see characters working through challenges using thoughtful choices and respecting others. Parents appreciate books that entertain their kids and support strong character development at the same time.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_jFAykq": {
          "type": "faq",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Are There Diverse and Inclusive Books for Kids in This Age Group?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>As parents, we want books that vary in culture, background, and experiences so our children develop empathy and tolerance. Luckily, there are amazing books available for children that feature:</p><ul><li>Characters of different races, ethnicities, and family structures.</li><li>Stories that highlight disabilities, neurodiversity, or gender expression.</li><li>Books that celebrate cultural traditions from around the world.</li></ul>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_X696LK": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h5>Looking for Something Else?</h5>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>We also have resources and books for children, no matter what stage they’re at. Browse our <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/toddler-books\" title=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/toddler-books\">toddler books</a> and <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/bundles\" title=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/bundles\">book bundles</a> designed to help your family keep great stories—and great conversations—going at every stage.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
